ce Dependencies (BFS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.5.2 P4; Sec.5.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_p5_build_output", "label": "P5 -- Build Output", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.5.2 P5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_p6_post_validate", "label": "P6 -- Post-Trim Validate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.5.2 P6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_p7_audit", "label": "P7 -- Finalize & Audit", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.5.2 P7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_f1_file_chopping", "label": "F1 -- File-Level Chopping", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.3.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_f2_proc_chopping", "label": "F2 -- Proc-Level Chopping", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.3.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_f3_run_file_generation", "label": "F3 -- Run-File Generation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.3.6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_r1_merge_rule", "label": "R1 -- Conflict Resolution and File Treatment (ordered overlay)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.4 R1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Base + selected features are folded left-to-right as an ordered overlay; the last layer that says something about a file/proc wins, so a feature can add, remove, or replace base content. Chosen so feature order is semantically authoritative for F1, F2, and F3 rather than an additive-only union of independent JSONs."}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_r2_default_exclude", "label": "R2 -- Default Action Is Exclude", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.4 R2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default-exclude is fixed and non-configurable; a global default-include mode was rejected so trimming behavior stays predictable and no file survives without an explicit authoring decision."}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_r3_tracing", "label": "R3 -- Tracing Is Default-On and Conservative", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.4 R3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tracing lowers authoring cost and trim risk during the 2-week delivery window by letting owners describe entry-point procs instead of enumerating full call chains. It is reporting-only by design: Chopper never guesses an unexpected proc into the surviving set, keeping users in full control via explicit JSON entries."}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_r4_plain_strings", "label": "R4 -- F3 Uses Plain Strings by Design", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.4 R4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Real flow steps are heterogeneous (filenames, source commands, ivar refs, #if/#else directives); forcing them into one rigid step datatype would recreate FlowBuilder-style complexity. Chopper trades full semantic validation for authoring flexibility, mitigated by cross-validation warnings against F1/F2 output."}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_r5_backup_rebuild", "label": "R5 -- Backup-and-Rebuild", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.4 R5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chopper never edits a domain in place; it renames the original to `_backup` on first trim and always rebuilds from that clean backup on re-trim. Chosen for safety and clean re-trim over destructive incremental editing."}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_base_json", "label": "Base JSON (base-v1 schema)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.3.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_feature_json", "label": "Feature JSON (feature-v1 schema)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.3.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_project_json", "label": "Project JSON (project-v1 schema)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.3.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_compiled_manifest", "label": "CompiledManifest (frozen P3 output)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "technical_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": "Sec.5.3; Sec.5.5.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "technical_docs_architecture_dependency_graph", "label": "dependency_graph.json (call-tree & file edges)", "file_type": "conc